      "name": "London Covent Garden",
      "description": "Discover a smartly designed hotel in the beating heart of Covent Garden. \n\nWe're a hotel that likes to make things easy - from the moment you book right through to lights out. Expect self check-in kiosks, super-fast free Wi-Fi, cleverly designed and compact bedrooms with all the entertainment and comfort you need. We're talking a 40\" Smart TV, temperature and lighting you can control via the hub by Premier Inn app, Hypnos bed and monsoon shower. \n\nOur Deli + Bar is open for grab-and-go hub brekkie, pastries, grilled sandwiches, Costa coffee, Brew Tea Co, beer, wine and more.",
