        "addressAsString": "110 St Martins Lane, London, WC2N 4BA"
      },
      "directions": "This hub hotel is opposite the London Coliseum theatre. The closest tube station is Leicester Square (Northern and Piccadilly lines). Charing Cross, Covent Garden and Embankment are close too. Arriving via Leicester Square: take exit 4, Cranbourne Street. hub by Premier Inn Covent Garden does not have a car park. We're so central we would encourage you to leave your car at home and arrive by public transport.",
